{"id": "cs_vlan_001", "vendor": "cisco", "domain": "vlan", "level": 2, "instruction": "创建 VLAN 20，命名为 sales，并把 GigabitEthernet0/1 配置为 access 口划入该 VLAN。", "context": "思科 Catalyst 2960 交换机，当前处于特权模式。", "reference": ["configure terminal", "vlan 20", "name sales", "exit", "interface GigabitEthernet0/1", "switchport mode access", "switchport access vlan 20"], "checkpoints": [{"id": "c1", "pattern": "^configure terminal$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "进入全局配置模式"}, {"id": "c2", "pattern": "^vlan 20$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "创建 VLAN"}, {"id": "c3", "pattern": "^name sales$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "命名"}, {"id": "c4", "pattern": "^interface gigabitethernet0/1$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "进入接口"}, {"id": "c5", "pattern": "^switchport mode access$", "weight": 1.5, "desc": "链路类型"}, {"id": "c6", "pattern": "^switchport access vlan 20$", "weight": 1.5, "desc": "划入 VLAN"}], "forbidden": ["port link-type", "port default vlan", "^system-view$", "^display "], "notes": "forbidden 里的 port link-type / display 是华为语法，命中即判厂商串味"}
{"id": "cs_iface_002", "vendor": "cisco", "domain": "interface", "level": 1, "instruction": "给 GigabitEthernet0/1 配置地址 172.16.0.1/24 并开启接口。", "context": "思科 ISR 路由器，当前处于特权模式。", "reference": ["configure terminal", "interface GigabitEthernet0/1", "ip address 172.16.0.1 255.255.255.0", "no shutdown"], "checkpoints": [{"id": "c1", "pattern": "^configure terminal$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "configure terminal"}, {"id": "c2", "pattern": "^interface gigabitethernet0/1$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "interface GigabitEthernet0/1"}, {"id": "c3", "pattern": "^ip address 172\\.16\\.0\\.1 (255\\.255\\.255\\.0|24)$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "ip address 172.16.0.1 255.255.255.0"}, {"id": "c4", "pattern": "^no shutdown$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "no shutdown"}], "forbidden": ["\\bport link-type\\b", "\\bport default vlan\\b", "^system-view$", "^display ", "^undo ", "\\beth-trunk\\b"], "notes": ""}
{"id": "cs_iface_003", "vendor": "cisco", "domain": "interface", "level": 1, "instruction": "把 GigabitEthernet0/2 的接口描述配置为 To-Server，并确保该接口处于开启状态。", "context": "思科 Catalyst 2960 交换机，当前处于特权模式。", "reference": ["configure terminal", "interface GigabitEthernet0/2", "description To-Server", "no shutdown"], "checkpoints": [{"id": "c1", "pattern": "^configure terminal$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "进入全局配置模式"}, {"id": "c2", "pattern": "^interface gigabitethernet0/2$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "进入正确接口"}, {"id": "c3", "pattern": "^description to-server$", "weight": 1.5, "desc": "配置描述"}, {"id": "c4", "pattern": "^no shutdown$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "开启接口"}], "forbidden": ["^system-view$", "^display ", "^undo ", "\\bport link-type\\b"], "notes": "forbidden 里的 undo / display 是华为语法"}
{"id": "cs_vlan_004", "vendor": "cisco", "domain": "vlan", "level": 2, "instruction": "把 GigabitEthernet0/1 配置为 trunk 口，只允许 VLAN 10 和 VLAN 20 通过。", "context": "思科 Catalyst 2960 交换机，VLAN 10 与 VLAN 20 已创建，当前处于特权模式。", "reference": ["configure terminal", "interface GigabitEthernet0/1", "switchport mode trunk", "switchport trunk allowed vlan 10,20"], "checkpoints": [{"id": "c1", "pattern": "^interface gigabitethernet0/1$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "进入接口"}, {"id": "c2", "pattern": "^switchport mode trunk$", "weight": 1.5, "desc": "链路类型改 trunk"}, {"id": "c3", "pattern": "^switchport trunk allowed vlan .*\\b10\\b", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "放行 VLAN 10"}, {"id": "c4", "pattern": "^switchport trunk allowed vlan .*\\b20\\b", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "放行 VLAN 20"}], "forbidden": ["\\bport link-type\\b", "\\bport default vlan\\b", "^system-view$", "^display "], "notes": "c3/c4 拆开，容忍 10,20 与分两行两种写法"}
{"id": "cs_route_005", "vendor": "cisco", "domain": "routing", "level": 1, "instruction": "配置一条默认静态路由，下一跳为 10.0.0.1。", "context": "思科 ISR 路由器，当前处于特权模式。", "reference": ["configure terminal", "ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 10.0.0.1"], "checkpoints": [{"id": "c1", "pattern": "^ip route 0\\.0\\.0\\.0 0\\.0\\.0\\.0 10\\.0\\.0\\.1$", "weight": 2.0, "desc": "默认路由"}], "forbidden": ["^ip route-static ", "^system-view$"], "notes": "forbidden 里的 ip route-static 是华为写法"}
{"id": "cs_acl_006", "vendor": "cisco", "domain": "acl", "level": 2, "instruction": "配置扩展 ACL 100，拒绝主机 192.168.1.10 访问服务器 10.0.0.5 的 80 端口，其余流量全部放行。", "context": "思科 ISR 路由器，当前处于特权模式。", "reference": ["configure terminal", "access-list 100 deny tcp host 192.168.1.10 host 10.0.0.5 eq 80", "access-list 100 permit ip any any"], "checkpoints": [{"id": "c1", "pattern": "^access-list 100 deny tcp host 192\\.168\\.1\\.10 host 10\\.0\\.0\\.5 eq (80|www)$", "weight": 2.0, "desc": "拒绝规则，eq 80 与 eq www 等价"}, {"id": "c2", "pattern": "^access-list 100 permit ip any any$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "放行其余"}], "forbidden": ["^acl number ", "^rule ", "^system-view$"], "notes": "forbidden 里的 acl number / rule 是华为写法"}
{"id": "cs_ospf_007", "vendor": "cisco", "domain": "routing", "level": 2, "instruction": "启动 OSPF 进程 1，router-id 设为 1.1.1.1，把 10.1.1.0/30 通告进区域 0。", "context": "思科 ISR 路由器，接口地址已配置，当前处于特权模式。", "reference": ["configure terminal", "router ospf 1", "router-id 1.1.1.1", "network 10.1.1.0 0.0.0.3 area 0"], "checkpoints": [{"id": "c1", "pattern": "^router ospf 1$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "启动 OSPF 进程"}, {"id": "c2", "pattern": "^router-id 1\\.1\\.1\\.1$", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "配置 router-id"}, {"id": "c3", "pattern": "^network 10\\.1\\.1\\.0 0\\.0\\.0\\.3 area 0$", "weight": 2.0, "desc": "通告网段，反掩码"}], "forbidden": ["^ospf 1", "^system-view$", "^display "], "notes": "华为是 ospf 1 router-id x 一行写完，思科分两行"}
{"id": "cs_pc_008", "vendor": "cisco", "domain": "interface", "level": 2, "instruction": "把 GigabitEthernet0/1 和 GigabitEthernet0/2 加入 LACP 主动模式的 port-channel 1。", "context": "思科 Catalyst 2960 交换机，当前处于特权模式。", "reference": ["configure terminal", "interface range GigabitEthernet0/1 - 2", "channel-group 1 mode active"], "checkpoints": [{"id": "c1", "pattern": "^channel-group 1 mode active$", "weight": 2.0, "desc": "加入聚合组，LACP 主动模式"}, {"id": "c2", "pattern": "^interface (range )?gigabitethernet0/1", "weight": 1.0, "desc": "进入成员口"}], "forbidden": ["\\beth-trunk\\b", "^system-view$", "\\bmode lacp-static\\b"], "notes": "串味重灾区：模型可能写成华为的 eth-trunk"}
